Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.24,0:00:39.58,Note,,0,0,0,,(乘务员专用 非紧急出口)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.66,0:00:41.83,Note,,0,0,0,,(伦敦西区公演)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.46,0:00:57.09,Note,,0,0,0,,(地铁　公共地下铁路)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.02,0:01:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.02,0:01:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,还要点别的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.40,0:01:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不  不了  暂时不用  我在等…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No, no, not just yet. I'm waiting...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.28,0:01:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我在等一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm expecting someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.53,0:02:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不是经常来光顾这家店\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would this be one of your regular haunts?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.62,0:02:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,其实也并没有经常来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have any regular haunts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.05,0:02:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,给我看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.85,0:02:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,有时我好像还觉得它依然挂在脖子上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes I imagine I still feel it around my neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.73,0:02:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟我戴了它这么多年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I carried it for so many years.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.52,0:02:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你戴着感觉如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How does it feel around yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.61,0:02:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以解除它的束缚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can free each other of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.78,0:02:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的麻瓜朋友们是不是很聒噪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Love to chatter, don't they, our Muggle friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.50,0:02:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,但是必须承认  他们泡的茶确实不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Though one must admit, they make a good cup of tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.79,0:02:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你的所作所为太过疯狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you're doing is madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.13,0:02:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我们约定过要一起做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's what we said we'd do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.42,0:02:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,当时太年轻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was young.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.88,0:03:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我还…  - 还对我承诺过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I was...  - Committed. To me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.39,0:03:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,关于我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.43,0:03:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.02,0:03:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾与你同道是因为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I went along because...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.73,0:03:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,因为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.85,0:03:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我爱上了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I was in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.69,0:03:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.36,0:03:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,但是原因并非如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that's not why you went along.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.45,0:03:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你说过我们要一起重塑这个世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was you who said we could reshape the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.70,0:03:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你说那是我们的权利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That it was our birthright.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.89,0:03:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你闻得到吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you smell it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.77,0:03:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,一股恶臭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The stench.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.40,0:03:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你当真打算背叛自己的同类吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you really intend to turn your back on your own kind?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.48,0:03:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,为了这些畜生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For these animals?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.70,0:04:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有你  我都将焚毁他们的世界  阿不思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With or without you, I'll burn down their world, Albus.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.08,0:04:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,无论你做什么都无法阻止我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing you can do to stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.37,0:04:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好好喝茶吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enjoy your cup of tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.91,0:05:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,它快生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.65,0:06:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,太美了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.70,0:06:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  你们两个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.62,0:06:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来  可能有点麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, the tricky bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.29,0:07:00.33,Note,,0,0,0,,(皇家辰星汽轮公司 纽约)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.15,0:07:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,箱子飞来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Accio.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.80,0:09:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,真的对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.55,0:09:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,双胞胎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twins.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.72,0:09:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你生了双胞胎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had twins.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.00,0:11:57.00,Note,,0,0,0,,《神奇动物3：邓布利多之谜》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.07,0:12:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,都回避\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.12,0:12:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,拿出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.80,0:12:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都说这个东西很特别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The others, they said it was special.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.34,0:12:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,它可是意义非凡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooh, it's beyond special.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.64,0:12:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.89,0:12:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,看到它眼睛了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See its eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.06,0:12:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,它的双眼能看透一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those eyes see everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.81,0:12:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,每当麒麟诞生之时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When a Qilin is born,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.11,0:12:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,能给世界带来变革的领袖  也会随之崛起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a righteous leader will rise to change our world forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.95,0:13:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,它的出生将带来改变  克雷登斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her birth brings change, Credence,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.91,0:13:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,改变一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.24,0:13:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,干得漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.21,0:13:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧  休息一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go. Rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.42,0:14:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.22,0:14:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.00,0:14:42.70,Note,,0,0,0,,(悬赏5000  通缉令  格林德沃)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.67,0:14:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,看来你不打算告诉我  这是要去做什么  对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't suppose you'd like to tell me what this is about, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.51,0:14:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,他就说要见一见  还让我一定要带上你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He just asked that we meet, and that I be sure to bring you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.51,0:14:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.51,0:14:55.72,Note,,0,0,0,,(霍格沃茨)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.44,0:15:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜你们是来这里找我哥哥的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here to meet my brother, I expect.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.66,0:15:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不  先生  我们来见阿不思·邓布利多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sir. We're here to see Albus Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.45,0:15:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,他就是我哥哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That would be my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.00,0:15:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉  我  太好了  我是纽特·斯卡曼德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry. I'm, um... Brilliant. I'm Newt Scamander,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.21,0:15:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这位是忒修斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and this is Theseus..
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.13,0:15:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,上二楼  左手第一个房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up the stairs. First on the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.85,0:15:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,纽特说过为何而来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has Newt told you why you're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.56,0:15:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他本该说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was he meant to?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.65,0:15:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.36,0:15:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,其实就是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As a matter of fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.32,0:15:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,有件事情  我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something that we, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.20,0:15:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,应该是邓布利多想和你谈一谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That, uh, Dumbledore wishes to speak to you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.66,0:15:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这算是一个提议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a proposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.83,0:15:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.58,0:16:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你肯定知道这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what this is, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.88,0:16:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,纽特在巴黎拿到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Newt had it in Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.21,0:16:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然不敢说我对这个东西有多么了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't say I have much experience with such things,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.30,0:16:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,但是它看上去是个血盟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it looks to me to be a blood troth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.84,0:16:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你说得没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That would be correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.22,0:16:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这里面装的是谁的血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And whose blood is contained within?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.22,0:16:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我的  还有格林德沃的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mine. And Grindelwald's.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.48,0:16:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这就是你不能对他出手的原因  - 是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm assuming that's why you can't move against him?  - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.19,0:16:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,他对我也是如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nor he against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.07,0:16:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,能问问你当初  为什么会做这样的事吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I ask, what would possess you to make such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.41,0:16:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,感情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Love.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.37,0:16:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,傲慢自大  幼稚无知  怎么选都行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arrogance. Naivete. Pick your poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.71,0:16:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们当时都很年轻  一心想改变这个世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were young, we were going to transform the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.05,0:16:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,就算有人变心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This ensured that we would,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.09,0:16:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,血盟也能保证计划继续进行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}even if one of us had a change of heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.13,0:16:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你要动手会有怎样的后果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what would happen if you were to fight him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.81,0:17:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不得不承认  这个东西真是太美了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's really quite beautiful, you have to admit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.36,0:17:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,哪怕我仅仅产生一丝和他作对的念头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were I to even think about defying it...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.29,0:17:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,它都能感觉到  你们看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It knows, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.97,0:17:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,阿不思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Albus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.93,0:17:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,它能感应到我心中的背叛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It senses the betrayal in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.39,0:17:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,阿不思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Albus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.06,0:17:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,阿不思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Albus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.32,0:17:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这还算是最轻的后果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That would be the least of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.62,0:18:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,虽是少年魔法  但如你们所见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Young man's magic, but as you can see,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.04,0:18:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,威力十分强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}powerful magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.09,0:18:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,根本无法可解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can't be undone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.02,0:18:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才说的提议  我想跟这麒麟有关是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So this proposal, I take it the Qilin has something to do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.64,0:18:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他保证过不会说出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He promises he won't tell a soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.73,0:18:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,如果想要打败他  麒麟是计划的一部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we're to defeat him, the Qilin's only part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.20,0:18:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们熟悉的世界正走向毁灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world as we know it is coming undone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.53,0:18:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,盖勒特利用仇恨与偏执\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gellert's pulling it apart with hate,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.83,0:18:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,将它分裂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}bigotry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.71,0:18:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,在今天看似不可想象的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Things that seem unimaginable today will seem
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.88,0:18:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,有可能在明天将不可避免\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}inevitable tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.42,0:18:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,除非我们阻止他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if we don't stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.84,0:18:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你若愿意按照我的吩咐去做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should you agree to do what I ask,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.26,0:19:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,就一定要相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'll have to trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.26,0:19:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,即使本能告诉你不要这样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even when every instinct tells you not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.36,0:19:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,说说看吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.35,0:19:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,是他派你来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does he send you
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.60,0:19:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,监视我的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to spy on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.43,0:19:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.52,0:19:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,但是他会问起你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he asks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.48,0:19:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,问你在想什么  情绪怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What ya thinkin', what ya feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.90,0:19:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,那其他人呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.03,0:19:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他也问他们的想法和感受吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does he ask what they're thinking and feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.90,0:19:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.24,0:20:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,可是  主要问的是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it's mostly you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.57,0:20:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你会告诉他吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And do you tell him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.33,0:20:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.00,0:20:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,现在是谁在读谁的想法呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's reading whose mind now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.76,0:20:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,说说你看到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.30,0:20:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你姓邓布利多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.68,0:20:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个很重要的家族\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an important family.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.93,0:20:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这事你知道  因为他告诉过你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know this because he's told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.77,0:20:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他也说过  是那家人抛弃了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's also told you they abandoned you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.65,0:20:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你的存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That you were a...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.74,0:20:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,是个见不得人的秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A dirty secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.78,0:20:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,他还说  邓布利多也抛弃了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um... He says Dumbledore abandoned him too,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.37,0:20:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,他懂你的感受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he knows how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.04,0:20:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,正因为如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And for that reason...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.50,0:20:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他才想让你亲手杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For that reason, he's asked you to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.38,0:21:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,请你离开这儿  奎妮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to go now, Queenie.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.80,0:21:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会告诉他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.56,0:21:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不是每次都说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not always.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.39,0:21:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,也没全说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.13,0:21:40.96,Note,,0,0,0,,(原谅我)
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.60,0:21:54.43,Note,,0,0,0,,(请进 营业中)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.30,0:22:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿  我们打…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, we're...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.80,0:22:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,奎妮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Queenie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.55,0:22:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨  亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.52,0:22:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.77,0:22:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你看你的烘焙坊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}look at your bakery.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.28,0:22:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,现在变得空荡荡的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like a ghost town.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.86,0:22:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  我太想你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, I missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.57,0:22:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,哦  宝贝儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.33,0:22:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,快过来好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.29,0:22:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,快过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.46,0:23:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿  所有事情一定会好起来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Everything's gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.18,0:23:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,所有的事情都会一切正常的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything's gonna be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.81,0:23:19.35,Note,,0,0,0,,(科瓦尔斯基烘焙坊)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.44,0:23:22.06,Note,,0,0,0,,(不招工)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.90,0:23:29.95,Note,,0,0,0,,(里文顿大街)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.46,0:23:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿  美女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, sweetheart,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.21,0:23:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么一个人来市里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what brings you downtown?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.55,0:23:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这么无聊的开场白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really hope
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.67,0:23:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,真希望不是你想了一整天才憋出来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you didn't spend all day coming up with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.47,0:23:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你想让我吓唬你  是这么想的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you want scary, is that what you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.97,0:23:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你其实也知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.89,0:23:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是没有吓人的气势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you just aren't menacing enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.39,0:24:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我气势还是挺吓人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I'm plenty menacing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.23,0:24:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我这样不吓人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I not menacing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.23,0:24:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你要是同时挥动双臂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe if you waved your arms around,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.53,0:24:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,来点儿疯疯癫癫的感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you know, like a crazy man,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.32,0:24:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那样看起来会更吓人一些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then you'd appear more menacing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.83,0:24:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样  再加把劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's good. A little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.37,0:24:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,动作再大一点儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.46,0:24:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不要停  非常好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep going. Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.21,0:24:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,三  二  一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three, two, one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.22,0:24:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,别胡闹了  快离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's enough. Get outta here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.26,0:24:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你想怎么样  烤面包的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's on your mind, baker boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.81,0:24:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天哪  你们该为自己感到羞愧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, jeez. You should be ashamed of yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.48,0:24:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没觉得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, well, we're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.94,0:24:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,她是个姑娘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.19,0:24:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,要不这样吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tell you what,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.15,0:24:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我让你先动手  来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll give you the first shot. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.82,0:24:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定  坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sure? Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.12,0:25:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我最后一次给那个女人帮忙了  拉莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last time I ever help that woman out again. Lally!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.58,0:25:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起  弗兰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoopsie, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.79,0:25:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,只是我有时候控制不住力道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes I forget my own strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.50,0:25:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,后面的事我自己来  真谢谢你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take it from here. Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.01,0:25:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不用客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.01,0:25:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,回头见  拉莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Catch you later, Lally.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.05,0:25:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,再见  斯坦利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye, Stanley.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.97,0:25:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,有时间我会去你家一起玩巫师游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be over for a game of Befudler Dudley soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.22,0:25:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.01,0:25:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我表哥斯坦利  他是个巫师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my cousin Stanley. He's a wizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.31,0:25:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.43,0:25:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了  一大早的  你就配合我一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please! It's early, don't make me work for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.27,0:25:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我说了我不想掺和进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said I wanted out, and I want out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.65,0:25:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样  科瓦尔斯基先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come now, Mr. Kowalski.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.06,0:25:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我的心理医生还说世上根本没有巫师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't believe my therapist said you wizards don't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.11,0:25:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那些钱都白花了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a waste of money!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.78,0:25:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我是个女巫  对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do know I'm a witch, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.95,0:25:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,对  听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.57,0:25:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你看起来像个好女巫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you seem like a really nice witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.45,0:25:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本不知道我经历了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know what I've been through with you people.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.33,0:25:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,能不能求求你别再来打扰我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, could you please get out of my life?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.75,0:25:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 大约是在一年多之前  - 我的天哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A little over a year ago...  - Oh, my...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.17,0:25:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,为了申请一笔贷款用来做点儿小生意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in the hopes of securing a small business loan,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.21,0:25:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你走进了斯蒂恩国家银行的大门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you walked through the doors of the Steen National Bank,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.51,0:25:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,距离这儿大约有六个街区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}located about six blocks from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.26,0:25:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你在那儿结识了纽特·斯卡曼德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You then made the acquaintance of Newt Scamander,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.05,0:25:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他是世上最杰出的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the world's foremost and,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.64,0:25:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,也是独一无二的神奇动物学家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}albeit only, magizoologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.68,0:26:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,从此你认识了一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You then learned of a world
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.89,0:26:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,自己之前从未察觉到的世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you had previously been wholly unaware of.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.64,0:26:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你和女巫奎妮·戈德斯坦恩相识相爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You met and fell in love with a witch named Queenie Goldstein,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.23,0:26:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,而后被一忘皆空咒抹去了记忆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}had your brain wiped by means of Obliviation,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.81,0:26:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,但是咒法没有生效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}only it didn't take.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.86,0:26:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,于是后来  你和戈德斯坦恩小姐重逢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And as a result, you reunited with Ms. Goldstein who,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.61,0:26:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,但是在你拒绝和她结婚之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}after your refusal to marry her, mm,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.74,0:26:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,她毅然加入了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}decided to join Gellert Grindelwald
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.78,0:26:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,盖勒特·格林德沃与他的邪恶大军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and his dark army of followers,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.12,0:26:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,而且他们是四百多年来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who pose the single greatest threat
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.91,0:26:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,对你我两个世界和平最大的威胁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to both your world and ours in four centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.24,0:26:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我说得怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.95,0:26:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,面面俱到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was good.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.00,0:26:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,除了奎妮变成坏人的那个部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except for the part about Queenie going over to the dark side.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.38,0:26:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说  对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, yeah, she's
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.50,0:26:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,她确实古灵精怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she's cuckoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.67,0:26:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,但是她的心地比这岛上所有人都善良\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But she's got a heart bigger than this whole crazy island,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.30,0:26:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,而且她还特别聪明  你知道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and she's so smart, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.14,0:26:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,她能知道你脑子里在想些什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She can legitimately read your brain, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.18,0:26:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 用你们的话…  - 叫摄神取念者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- she's a whatchamacallit...  - A Legilimens.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.97,0:26:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.77,0:26:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.23,0:26:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,看见这个了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.90,0:26:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,看到这锅了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see the pan?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.15,0:26:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我就好比这个平底锅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's me, I'm the pan.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.78,0:27:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,破旧不堪而且平平无奇  普通人一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm all dented, dime-a-dozen. I'm just a schmo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.12,0:27:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然我还不知道  你到底有什么疯狂的打算\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what kind of crazy ideas you have in your head there,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.29,0:27:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,女士  但是你肯定能找到  比我更合适的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lady, but I'm sure as hell you could do a lot better than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.87,0:27:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.58,0:27:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我不这么认为  科瓦尔斯基先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think we can, Mr. Kowalski.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.59,0:27:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你明明可以躲在柜台后  可是你没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could have ducked under the counter, but you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.38,0:27:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你完全可以冷眼旁观  可是你也没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could have looked the other way, but you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.88,0:27:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,事实就是  你情愿以身犯险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In fact, you were willing to put yourself in danger
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.64,0:27:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,也要去帮助一个完全陌生的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to save a perfect stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.26,0:27:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,依我看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seems to me
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.18,0:27:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这个世界现在正需要  像你这样的普通人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're just the kind of average Joe the world needs right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.64,0:27:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,只是你自己还没发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just don't know it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.56,0:27:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我来帮你看清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why I had to show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.15,0:27:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要你  科瓦尔斯基先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need you, Mr. Kowalski.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.12,0:27:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.33,0:27:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,叫雅各布就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call me Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.83,0:27:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫拉莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call me Lally.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.04,0:27:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,拉莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lally.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.50,0:27:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我得把门锁好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta lock up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.71,0:27:56.21,Note,,0,0,0,,(抱歉 本店已打烊)
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.30,0:27:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢  - 这样好多了  雅各布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks.  - Much better, Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.77,0:28:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你知道这是怎么回事吧  雅各布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe you know how this works, Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.63,0:28:44.50,Note,,0,0,0,,(通缉令 悬赏: 5000)
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.51,0:28:46.00,Note,,0,0,0,,(胜者将是谁 刘还是桑托斯)
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.35,0:28:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,魔法部那边是怎么说的  刘还是桑托斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did they say at the Ministry? Liu or Santos?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.39,0:28:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,官方说法是魔法部保持中立\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Officially, the Ministry takes no position.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.40,0:28:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,可是私下里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unofficially,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.19,0:28:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,聪明人都押桑托斯赢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}smart money's on Santos.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.32,0:28:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不过  换任何人都比沃格尔好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Although anyone would be better than Vogel.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.61,0:29:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,任何人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.24,0:29:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,选票上又没有他  卡玛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe he's on the ballot, Kama.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.83,0:29:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,而且他还是一名逃犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He also happens to be a fugitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.87,0:29:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这有什么区别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there a difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.17,0:29:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,还在转  每次都天旋地转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spinning! Always with the spinning.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.08,0:29:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,雅各布  欢迎欢迎  我的好伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob. Welcome. You brilliant man.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.30,0:29:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.59,0:29:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,当初我就知道  希克斯教授一定可以说动你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was absolutely sure that Professor Hicks would convince you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.80,0:29:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  你是了解我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. You know me, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.05,0:29:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,门钥匙这么好玩绝不能错过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't pass up a good Portkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.56,0:29:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,斯卡曼德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Scamander.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.06,0:29:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,希克斯教授  我们终于见面了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Professor Hicks. At long last.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.31,0:29:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,那个  我和希克斯教授  多年来一直有书信往来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, Professor Hicks and I, we've corresponded for many years,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.90,0:29:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,可是一直未曾谋面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but we've never actually met.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.86,0:29:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,她的高级魔咒学著作可是必读的作品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, her book on advanced charm casting is a must-read.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.19,0:29:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,纽特  你实在太客气了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Newt is far too kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.86,0:29:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,《神奇动物》这本书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fantastic Beasts
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.11,0:29:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,也是我布置给五年级学生的必读书籍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is required reading for all my fifth years.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.70,0:29:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,现在  我来给大家介绍一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, let me make some introductions.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.54,0:29:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这位是  邦缇·布罗德克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, this is, um, Bunty Broadacre,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.12,0:29:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,是我这七年来不可或缺的好助手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my indispensable assistant for the past seven years.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.16,0:29:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,其实是八年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eight... years.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.38,0:29:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,又过了一百六十四天了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And 164 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.84,0:30:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,看见了吧  她不可或缺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you can see, indispensable.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.84,0:30:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这一位他是…  - 尤瑟夫·卡玛  幸会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And this is...  - Yusuf Kama. Pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.89,0:30:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,而且毫无疑问  你已经见过雅各布了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you, obviously, already made Jacob's acquaintance.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.52,0:30:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,纽特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Newt.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.64,0:30:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,对了  这是我哥哥忒修斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So... So, this is my brother, Theseus,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.02,0:30:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,现在他在魔法部工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and, um, he works for the Ministry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.98,0:30:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,其实我是英国傲罗办公室的负责人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, head of the British Auror Office.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.57,0:30:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那我可得查查  确保我的魔杖注册没过期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'll have to ensure my wand registration's up to date.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.28,0:30:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.16,0:30:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不过严格地说  那不是我的管辖范围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Although, strictly speaking, that doesn't fall within my purview.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.47,0:30:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  好  我猜大家一定在想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right then. Well, I imagine that you're all wondering
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.14,0:30:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,自己为什么会到这儿来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}why you find yourselves here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.39,0:30:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,好在  邓布利多早有预料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in anticipation of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.85,0:31:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,并且让我来给在座的各位传个话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dumbledore asked that I convey a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.15,0:31:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,既然格林德沃拥有能预知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, Grindelwald has the ability
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.07,0:31:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,并看见未来片段的能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to see snatches of the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.94,0:31:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得假设他能在我们行动之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, we have to assume that he'll be able to anticipate
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.86,0:31:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,就知晓详细情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what we do before we do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.99,0:31:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,所以  如果我们想要打败他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, if we hope to defeat him
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.87,0:31:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,来拯救我们的世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and to save our world,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.75,0:31:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,并且拯救你的世界  雅各布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to save your world, Jacob,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.08,0:31:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那么  我们最好的方法就是去迷惑他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then our best hope is to confuse him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.67,0:31:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,打断一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Scuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.67,0:31:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起  要怎样迷惑一个  能预知未来的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. How do you confuse a guy that can see the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.18,0:31:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,用反视法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Countersight.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.30,0:31:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,完全正确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.26,0:31:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,最好的计划就是没有计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The best plan being no plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.10,0:31:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,又或者  许多个互相交错的计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or, many overlapping plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.27,0:31:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,就这么迷惑他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thus, confusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.56,0:31:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我已经糊涂了  - 事实上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's working on me right now.  - In fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.06,0:31:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,邓布利多让我给你一件东西  雅各布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dumbledore asked that I give you something, Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.66,0:31:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,蛇木做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's snakewood.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.33,0:31:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,所以  也算是稀有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's, uh, somewhat rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.04,0:31:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你没跟我开玩笑吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you kiddin' me right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.21,0:32:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这个是真的  - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is this thing real?  - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.13,0:32:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不过它没有杖芯  所以说  算是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it doesn't have a core, so sort of, but yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.34,0:32:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,算是真家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's sorta real?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.93,0:32:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,更重要的是  我们去的地方你会用得上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More importantly, where we're going, you'll need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.93,0:32:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,对了  忒修斯  我想这个是给你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, there's something for you too, I think, Theseus.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.27,0:32:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,泰迪  乖  快松手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Teddy, please let go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.69,0:32:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,泰迪  快点儿松手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Teddy, please let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.27,0:32:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样  泰迪  听话好不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Teddy, will you behave?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.94,0:32:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这个是给忒修斯的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Theseus'...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.32,0:32:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.74,0:32:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,对  没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.74,0:32:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,现在一切都说得通了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now everything makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.54,0:32:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,拉莉  我想你已经收到阅读材料了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um, Lally, I believe you were given some reading material?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.37,0:32:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,有句俗话说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.50,0:32:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,书能载你游遍世界再回到原地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A book can take you around the world and back,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.38,0:32:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,只需要打开书本就能做到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all you have to do is open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.21,0:32:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,她说得对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She ain't kiddin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.30,0:32:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,对了  还有邦缇  是给你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, uh, Bunty, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.63,0:32:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这个东西  他吩咐过我  只能给你一个人看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's for you. I was told it was for your eyes only.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.82,0:33:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还有  卡玛  - 我已万事俱备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And, Kama.  - I have what I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.74,0:33:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,蒂娜呢  她…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about Tina?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.99,0:33:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 蒂娜会来吗  - 蒂娜抽不出时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Uh, is Tina coming?  - Tina's not available.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.95,0:33:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,蒂娜她升职了  现在非常非常忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tina's been promoted, she's very, very busy from...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.21,0:33:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,据我所知是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, from what I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.71,0:33:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,蒂娜现在担任  美国傲罗办公室的负责人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tina's been made head of the American Auror Office.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.71,0:33:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们两个很熟  她是一个很了不起的女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know each other well. She's quite a remarkable woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.05,0:33:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,确实是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She is.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.14,0:33:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那么就是这支队伍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, this is the team that's gonna take down
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.05,0:33:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,要去对抗一百年来  最危险的黑巫师吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the most dangerous wizard we've faced in over a century.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.77,0:33:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,一个神奇动物学家和他的得力助手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A magizoologist, his indispensable assistant,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.23,0:33:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,一名教师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a schoolteacher,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.44,0:33:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,一个出身于法国古老魔法世家的巫师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a wizard descended from a very old French family, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.98,0:33:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,还有拿着假魔杖的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a Muggle baker
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.98,0:33:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,麻瓜烘焙师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with his fake wand.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.15,0:33:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还有你  伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, we got you too, pal,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.28,0:33:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,他有个真魔杖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and his wand works.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.03,0:33:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}true
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.79,0:34:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,谁说我们没有胜算来着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who wouldn't like our chances?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.59,0:34:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,[德语] 女士们 先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.76,0:34:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,途经德累斯顿和布拉格 前往布拉迪斯拉发的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Via Dresden and Prague to Bratislava...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.01,0:34:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,…特快列车已抵达六号站台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...The express train has arrived at platform 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.23,0:34:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,请立即上车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please get on the bus immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.56,0:34:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的  小家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're all right, little one.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.99,0:34:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,柏林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Berlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.66,0:34:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.79,0:34:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,卡玛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kama,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.75,0:34:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,注意安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}stay safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.72,0:35:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在也得走了  纽特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must be going too now, Newt.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.77,0:35:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人可以知道一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one can know everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.52,0:35:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not even you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.56,0:35:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.39,0:35:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,对  就是这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.71,0:36:12.46,Note,,0,0,0,,(安东·沃格尔)
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.63,0:36:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们要去德国魔法部吗  - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- German Ministry of Magic?  - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.51,0:36:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来这里一定有原因吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I take it we're here for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.18,0:36:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  我们现在得去参加一个茶会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, we have a tea ceremony to attend,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.31,0:36:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,而且如果不抓紧时间  就赶不上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and if we don't hurry up, we'll be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.56,0:36:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,雅各布  快跟上队伍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob, stay with the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.45,0:36:39.50,Note,,0,0,0,,(格林德沃  因严重恶性犯罪并密谋 颠覆魔法世界而被通缉)
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.50,0:36:41.10,Note,,0,0,0,,(巫师法力强大且极度危险 悬赏：5000)
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.11,0:36:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,桑托斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Santos!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.37,0:36:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,桑托斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Santos! Santos! Santos!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.96,0:36:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,桑托斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Santos! Santos! Santos!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.92,0:37:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,刘洮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Liu Tao.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.13,0:37:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evening...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.68,0:37:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,赫尔穆特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Helmut.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.80,0:37:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,忒修斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Theseus.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.76,0:37:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,[德语] 他们哪儿来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did they come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.64,0:37:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿  一起的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hey. They're with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.93,0:37:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,桑托斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Santos! Santos!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.32,0:37:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,桑托斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Santos!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.45,0:37:27.95,Note,,0,0,0,,(投维辛西亚·桑托斯一票)
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.95,0:37:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,桑托斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Santos!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.67,0:37:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,火焰熊熊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Incendio.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.75,0:37:38.25,Note,,0,0,0,,(最高领导 巴西国际巫师联合会)
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.50,0:37:39.63,Note,,0,0,0,,(投维辛西亚·桑托斯一票)
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.82,0:38:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们应该不是来吃小三明治的  - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I take it we're not here for the finger sandwiches.  - Uh, no,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.95,0:38:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我是来这儿给人传话的  - 传什么话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I have a message to deliver.  - A message?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.95,0:38:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,给谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To who?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.91,0:38:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,沃格尔先生  很荣幸能见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Vogel, it's a pleasure to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.62,0:38:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你好  不必客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an honor to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.54,0:38:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你在开玩笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.34,0:38:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.63,0:38:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我来这里做什么  我们出去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What am I even doing here? Let's go outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.92,0:38:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我不擅长应对这种场合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not very good in these situations.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.97,0:38:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这种场合怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These situations?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.26,0:38:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这么多人  还都是达官显贵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With all the people, the fancy people.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.89,0:38:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.72,0:38:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我看见你走进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw you enter the room
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.98,0:38:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,当时心里就在想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I thought to myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.60,0:38:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,伊迪丝  那个人看上去真是有趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Edith, that's an interesting-looking man.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.69,0:38:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,雅各布·科瓦尔斯基\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob Kowalski.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.03,0:38:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你好吗  很高兴见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are you? Very nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.07,0:38:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,科瓦尔斯基先生  你从哪里来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And where is it you hail from, Mr. Kowalski?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.32,0:38:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,皇后区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Queens.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.87,0:38:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿  沃格尔先生  打扰一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, Herr Vogel. Sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.75,0:38:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,能跟您说句话吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wonder if I could have a word?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.42,0:39:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,梅林胡子  你是斯卡曼德先生吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merlin's beard, it's Mr. Scamander, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.00,0:39:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,沃格尔先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Herr Vogel...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.21,0:39:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系  不用过来  没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay. Don't come here. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.09,0:39:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,一位朋友托我给您带话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a message from a friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.72,0:39:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,而且  情况十万火急\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it cannot wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.31,0:39:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,去做正义之事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do what is right,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.85,0:39:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,而非容易之事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not what is easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.11,0:39:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他说这很重要  让我今晚务必找到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said it was important that I reach you tonight,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.32,0:39:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,再把这句话亲口告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you hear them tonight, the words.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.74,0:39:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,到时间了  先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.08,0:39:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,现在他在柏林吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he here? In Berlin?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.25,0:39:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不  他当然不在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.42,0:39:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,世界一片火海  为什么要离开霍格沃茨呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why leave Hogwarts when the world outside is burning?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.05,0:39:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你  斯卡曼德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thank you, Mr. Scamander.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.38,0:40:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,非常感谢  谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.89,0:40:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚在这里我看到了许多熟悉的面孔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see many familiar faces here tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.35,0:40:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,同事们  朋友们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colleagues, friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.44,0:40:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,对手们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}foes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.86,0:40:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,在接下来的四十八小时之内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Within the next 48 hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.15,0:40:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,诸位将与魔法世界的同胞们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you, along with the rest of the Wizarding World,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.41,0:40:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,一起选出我们的下一届领导者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will choose our next great leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.37,0:40:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们眼下做出的选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A choice that will shape our lives
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.83,0:41:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,将塑造子孙后代的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for generations to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.79,0:41:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我本人对此丝毫不怀疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have little doubt that,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.46,0:41:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,无论是谁赢得本次选举\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no matter who should triumph,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.75,0:41:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,接任魔法联盟的都是一位有才之人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Confederation will be in able hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.26,0:41:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,无论是刘洮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Liu Tao.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.22,0:41:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,或是维辛西亚·桑托斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vicencia Santos.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.85,0:41:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢  谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.57,0:41:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,而且在这样的时刻  让我们牢记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's in moments such as these we are reminded
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.40,0:41:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,正是这般权力的和平交接\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that it is this peaceful transfer of power
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.66,0:41:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,代表着我们的人文精神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which marks our humanity
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.87,0:41:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,并向全魔法界表明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and demonstrates to the world that,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.41,0:41:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管我们之间存在分歧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}despite our differences,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.58,0:41:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,但是所有人都有发声的权利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all voices deserve to be heard...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.17,0:41:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,即便是那种  很多人都不乐意听到的声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}even voices which many may find disagreeable.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.42,0:41:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,纽特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Newt.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.13,0:41:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那些人里有没有眼熟的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any of those lot look familiar to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.01,0:41:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,在巴黎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.85,0:42:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,莉塔出事那晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The night that Leta...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.02,0:42:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是格林德沃的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were with Grindelwald.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.12,0:42:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,综上所述  在经过广泛细致的调查之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so, after an extensive investigation,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.75,0:42:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,国际巫师联合会现已对案件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Confederation has concluded
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.92,0:42:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,作出判决  同时也已认定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that insufficient evidence exists
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.25,0:42:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,起诉被告人盖勒特·格林德沃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to prosecute Gellert Grindelwald
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.05,0:42:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,对麻瓜社会所犯种种罪行一案  证据不足\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the crimes against the Muggle community
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.76,0:42:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,所以在此免除\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of which he was accused.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.97,0:42:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他之前所有被指控的罪行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is hereby absolved of all his alleged crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.90,0:42:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,开玩笑的吧  要给他脱罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you kidding me? They're letting the guy off?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.32,0:42:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,他杀人的时候我就在场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was there, he was killing people.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.99,0:42:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你们被捕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're under arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.11,0:42:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你们所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.37,0:42:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,放下魔杖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wands down!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.12,0:43:06.00,Note,,0,0,0,,{\b0\fs40}[德语] {\rChs}把他带走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take him away.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.67,0:43:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,忒修斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Theseus.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.29,0:43:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,忒修斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Theseus!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.34,0:43:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,纽特  现在不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Newt, Newt. Not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.38,0:43:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,纽特  我们在这儿没有胜算\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Newt, we don't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.80,0:43:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.47,0:43:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,纽特  这儿已经被他们占领了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Newt, they have the German Ministry.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.35,0:43:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们必须赶紧走  - 真的假的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We've got to go.  - Whoa, whoa, whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.27,0:43:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这样不对  根本就不是正义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It ain't right. That's not justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.35,0:43:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,还广泛细致的调查  我就在场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Extended investigation." I was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.48,0:43:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你在场  你在场吗  我就在场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were you there? Were you there? I was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.06,0:43:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你们放走了凶手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just let a killer off!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.98,0:43:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,雅各布  得走了  赶快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob. We have to go. We have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.90,0:43:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,雅各布  我们快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.31,0:44:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,味道很不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.82,0:44:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,她最喜欢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.40,0:44:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,以前她总问妈妈要  记得吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember how she begged Mother to make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.58,0:44:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,阿利安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ariana.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.96,0:44:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,母亲说这能让她平静下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother claimed it calmed her,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.00,0:44:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 可是我觉她是一厢情愿  - 阿不思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- but I think that was wishful thinking.  - Albus.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.46,0:44:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我也在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.51,0:44:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在一个屋檐下长大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I grew up in the same house.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.22,0:44:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你看到的一切我都见过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything you saw, I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.14,0:44:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,所有东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.28,0:45:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,看看门上的牌子  你这个蠢货\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Read the sign, you stupid sod.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.25,0:45:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉来打扰你  阿不思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry to disturb you, Albus.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.00,0:45:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,说吧  怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.75,0:45:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,柏林出事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Berlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.05,0:45:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.71,0:45:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,沃格尔  他已经赦免了  盖勒特的全部罪行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vogel has absolved Gellert of all his crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.89,0:45:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他自由了  说是证据不足\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's free. He says there's no proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.81,0:45:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,在莉塔·莱斯特兰奇被杀当晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He tried to arrest Aurors who were there
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.52,0:45:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他还试图逮捕那些当时在场的傲罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the night Leta Lestrange was murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.31,0:45:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,纽特  拉莉  还有那个麻瓜都没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Newt, Lally, and the Muggle are all fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.69,0:45:35.90,Note,,0,0,0,,(你知道是怎样的感觉吗)
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.06,0:45:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他们逃了出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They managed to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.91,0:45:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,真是令人失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rather disappointing.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.24,0:45:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我得找人帮我代一下明天早上的课\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to need someone to cover my morning classes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.58,0:45:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 能不能请你帮个忙  - 当然可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can I impose on you?  - Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.71,0:45:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 阿不思  请一定…  - 好的  我  我尽量吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And, Albus, please be...  - I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.92,0:45:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上好  阿不福思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evening, Aberforth.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.92,0:45:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上好  麦格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evening, Minerva.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.59,0:46:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起  刚才我说你是个蠢货\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apologies for calling you a stupid sod.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.76,0:46:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我接受你这个道歉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apology accepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.39,0:46:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕我今晚不能在这儿久留了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid I'll have to cut our evening short.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.02,0:46:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,要去拯救世界了  对吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Off to save the world, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.77,0:46:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,那得找一个比我厉害的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That will take a better man than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.02,0:46:20.90,Note,,0,0,0,,(你知道孤身一人 是怎样的感觉吗)
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.98,0:46:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,问都别问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.00,0:46:34.65,Note,,0,0,0,,(你知道孤身一人 是怎样的感觉吗)
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.86,0:47:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,成千上万人都在街头高呼你的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are thousands in the streets chanting your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.57,0:47:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在自由了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a free man.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.58,0:47:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,去通知他们准备出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell the others to prepare to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.04,0:47:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 今晚走  - 明天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tonight?  - Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.37,0:47:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,明早有个人会过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll have a visitor in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.59,0:47:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,凤凰为什么总跟着他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why does it stay with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.68,0:47:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,一定是察觉到了他要做的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It must sense what he's about to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.64,0:47:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你能确定…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're sure
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.43,0:47:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他真杀得了邓布利多吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that he can kill Dumbledore?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.69,0:47:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,痛苦使他强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His pain is his power.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.36,0:47:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我打听的那个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man that I am inquiring about
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.07,0:47:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,现在可是英国傲罗办公室的负责人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is the head of the British Auror Office.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.87,0:47:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你们怎么能把\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can you have misplaced
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.78,0:47:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,英国傲罗办公室的负责人给弄丢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the head of the British Auror Office?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.00,0:47:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才就已经说清楚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As our contention said,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.29,0:47:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们从来就没有抓过他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}since he was never in our custody,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.79,0:48:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能把他弄丢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we never misplaced him.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.92,0:48:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,先生  当晚有几十人在场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, there were dozens of people there.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.05,0:48:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 任何一个人都可以作证  - 你的名字是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Any one of them could corroborate...  - And your name is?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.21,0:48:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还是走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.09,0:48:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下  就是那个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute, that's the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.26,0:48:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,对不…过来  你过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.89,0:48:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,麻烦等一下  嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.14,0:48:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,就是那个人  他知道忒修斯在哪儿  你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the guy. He knows where Theseus is. Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.44,0:48:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,忒修斯在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Theseus?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.23,0:48:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,就是他  他知道忒修斯的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's him. He knows about Theseus.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.42,0:48:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,纽特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Newt.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.06,0:49:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,阿不思  我们…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Albus.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.78,0:49:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,忒修斯是被带到厄克斯塔去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Theseus has been taken to the Erkstag.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.28,0:49:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,可那里不是好几年前就关闭了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, no, but the Erkstag shut down years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.66,0:49:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,对  不过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.87,0:49:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,德国魔法部把那里  改造成一个秘密关押点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's the Ministry's secret little bed and breakfast now.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.08,0:49:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,拿着这个才能见到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll need this to see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.33,0:49:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,还有这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And one of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.92,0:49:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,和这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.22,0:49:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.93,0:49:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来  新魔杖挺满意  科瓦尔斯基先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I trust you're enjoying your wand, Mr. Kowalski?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.39,0:49:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.31,0:49:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你  邓布利多先生  那是个好东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, uh... Yeah, thank you, Mr. Dumbledore. It's a real pip.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.39,0:49:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,建议你最好随身携带  希克斯教授\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I advise you to keep it close. Professor Hicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.60,0:49:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,邓布利多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.52,0:49:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,如果说  你有空闲时间的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Assuming you're not otherwise engaged,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.90,0:49:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不过即便你有安排\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and frankly even if you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.15,0:49:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是建议你去参加  今晚的候选人晚宴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I encourage you to attend tonight's candidates' dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.78,0:49:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,带上科瓦尔斯基\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take Mr. Kowalski.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.36,0:49:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚一定会有人企图行刺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm quite certain there'll be an assassination attempt.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.91,0:49:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是能阻止那人的计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything you can do to scotch that
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.87,0:49:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我会十分感激的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will be greatly appreciated.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.12,0:50:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我义不容辞  乐意接受这个挑战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my pleasure. I shall welcome the challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.45,0:50:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,更何况  我还有雅各布帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, I'll have Jacob with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.62,0:50:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,用不着担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, not to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.58,0:50:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,希克斯教授的防御魔法  可谓是炉火纯青\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Professor Hicks' defensive magic is superb.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.88,0:50:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们回头见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.09,0:50:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他真会说话  不过  他没说错  炉火纯青\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Such a flatterer. Well, not really. It is superb.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.51,0:50:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,阿不思  我想问一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Albus! I was just wondering...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.06,0:50:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.02,0:50:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 手提箱  - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The case.  - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.44,0:50:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你就放心吧  它由可靠之人保管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rest assured, it's in safe hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.66,0:50:39.62,Note,,0,0,0,,(奥托·爱德华皮革制品)
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.87,0:50:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,要帮忙吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.91,0:50:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.42,0:50:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,麻烦你帮我仿制一下这只手提箱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to have this case replicated, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.71,0:50:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.21,0:50:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不  千万别打开它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. No, you mustn't open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.09,0:50:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说  其实没有那个必要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um, I mean, it's not necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.47,0:51:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,里面是什么样并不重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The interior isn't important.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.68,0:51:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,要仿制这个手提箱的确没什么问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see no reason I can't make you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.02,0:51:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,快进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.12,0:51:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 东西留这儿就行  - 哦  不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- If you leave it here.  - Oh. No...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.20,0:51:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我不可以留下它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't leave it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.16,0:51:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,还有我需要不止一个仿制品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'll be needing more than one.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.88,0:51:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.46,0:51:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,是我丈夫  他这个人粗心大意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My husband... he's a bit absentminded.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.34,0:51:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,总是会忘东忘西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's always forgetting things.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.09,0:51:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,前几天他连跟我结了婚都忘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just the other day, he forgot he was married to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.56,0:51:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是很离谱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you imagine?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.15,0:51:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,但我很爱他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.02,0:51:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,那请问你到底是想做几个呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly how many were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.48,0:51:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要六个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Half a dozen,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.57,0:51:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,而且两天后我就得取货\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'll need them in two days' time.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.33,0:52:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,把手举起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.71,0:52:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.84,0:52:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫尤瑟夫·卡玛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Yusuf Kama.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.39,0:52:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 来访的是哪位啊  - 你的仰慕者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's our visitor?  - I'm an admirer.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.01,0:52:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你杀了他的妹妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You murdered his sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.93,0:52:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,她的名字叫莉塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her name was Leta.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.65,0:52:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,莉塔·莱斯特兰奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leta Lestrange.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.73,0:52:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.65,0:52:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你们兄妹同属一支古老的血统  - 曾经是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You and your sister share an ancient bloodline.  - Shared.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.28,0:52:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们的唯一共同点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the only thing we shared.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.49,0:52:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,邓布利多派你来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dumbledore sent you,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.41,0:52:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,对不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.45,0:52:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他怕你已经得到了某只动物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He fears you're in possession of a creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.58,0:52:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,也怕你将用它来做的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He fears the use you may put it to.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.79,0:52:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,是他派我来监视你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He sent me here to spy on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.00,0:52:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你想让我告诉他些什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would you like me to tell him?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.55,0:53:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,奎妮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Queenie.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.05,0:53:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他说的是真话吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he telling the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.15,0:53:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,还有什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.57,0:53:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他虽然信奉你的理念\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even though he believes in you,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.57,0:53:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,但心中仍放不下你的杀妹之仇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he holds you responsible for his sister's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.99,0:53:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他时刻思念着逝去的妹妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He carries her absence with him every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.16,0:53:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,每一次呼吸都提醒着他  妹妹已经不在了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every breath he takes is a reminder that she breathes no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.13,0:53:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那你应该不会介意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I presume you won't mind
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.30,0:53:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我把你从痛苦的记忆里解放出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if I relieve you of your sister's memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.84,0:53:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.01,0:53:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.41,0:54:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.91,0:54:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.04,0:54:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我想也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.88,0:54:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,当我们允许自己被愤怒所吞噬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we allow ourselves to be consumed by anger,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.17,0:54:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,那只是作茧自缚罢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the only victim is ourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.51,0:54:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我们刚要做好准备出发呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, we were just about to depart.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.35,0:54:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,要不要和我们一起走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps you'd like to join us?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.56,0:54:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.85,0:54:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以多聊聊  那位共同的朋友  邓布利多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we can talk some more about our mutual friend, Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.82,0:54:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你先请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.61,0:55:24.49,Note,,0,0,0,,(瓦尔彻旅行社)
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.07,0:56:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你好  克雷登斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Credence.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.04,0:56:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道举目无亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know what it's like
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.96,0:56:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,总是孤身一人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to have no one?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.13,0:56:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,是怎样的感觉吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To always be alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.30,0:56:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.72,0:56:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是在镜子上留言的那个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the one sending messages in the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.02,0:56:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我姓邓布利多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.35,0:56:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你们却抛弃了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You abandoned me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.73,0:56:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你我的身上流淌着  来自同一家族的血脉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The same blood that runs my veins runs yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.45,0:56:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,它不是为你而来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.66,0:56:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,是为了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's here for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.34,0:57:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,事情真相往往并非如你所见  克雷登斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Things are not quite what they appear, Credence,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.67,0:57:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不管别人告诉了你什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no matter what you've been told.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.26,0:57:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我的名字是奥睿利乌斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Aurelius.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.18,0:57:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,他欺骗了你  点燃了你的怒火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's lied to you. Kindled your hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.70,0:59:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他告诉你的不是真相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What he's told you isn't true...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.21,0:59:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我们确实有血缘关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but we do share the same blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.00,0:59:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你的确姓邓布利多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are a Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.02,0:59:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉你这么痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry for your pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.81,0:59:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们之前真的不知情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We didn't know, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.35,1:00:07.10,Note,,0,0,0,,(禁止入内 不得擅闯)
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.24,1:00:18.86,Note,,0,0,0,,(厄克斯塔)
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.99,1:00:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我是来这儿看我哥哥的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've come to see my brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.75,1:00:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他叫做忒修斯·斯卡曼德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His name is Theseus Scamander.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.51,1:00:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉  那是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, that's, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.72,1:00:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,魔杖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wand.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.40,1:00:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那是…我是一名神奇动物学家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that's, uh... I'm... I'm a magizoologist.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.07,1:01:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,它是完全无害的  这个小家伙就是个小宠物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's perfectly harmless. He's... He's just a pet, really.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.00,1:01:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.54,1:01:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,那是泰迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Teddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.54,1:01:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,老实说  它可不是个省油的灯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a total nightmare, truth be told.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.29,1:01:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,它们得留在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.73,1:01:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么才能知道他在哪儿呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, how will I know where to find him?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.57,1:01:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不是你哥哥吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's your brother?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.07,1:01:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的  - 你按照他的长相去找不就成了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes.  - He will be the one who looks like your brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.33,1:01:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我去去就回  皮克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will be back, Pick.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.33,1:01:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,说到做到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On my word.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.72,1:02:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我去去就回  皮克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I'll be back, Pick."
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.09,1:02:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,说到做到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"On my word."
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.60,1:02:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,说不定我哪天还能当上魔法部部长呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'll be Minister of Magic one day.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.18,1:02:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把车开到后门去  这里不安全  - 不用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Take us 'round the back. It's not safe here.  - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.44,1:02:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 摇下来  - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Roll it down.  - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.65,1:02:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,车窗  把它摇下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The window. Roll it down.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.91,1:03:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,格林德沃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grindelwald! Grindelwald!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.04,1:03:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不  不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.85,1:03:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,那些人不是建议我们倾听他们的声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those people aren't suggesting we listen to them.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.10,1:03:32.35,Note,,0,0,0,,(格林德沃 投维辛西亚·桑托斯一票)
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.43,1:03:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,同样也不是提出请求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They aren't asking us to listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.98,1:03:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在强烈要求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're demanding it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.48,1:03:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会真的提议  允许那个人参与竞选吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're actually proposing that that man be allowed to stand?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.15,1:03:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.99,1:03:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,就是要让他参选\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, let him stand.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.65,1:03:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,格林德沃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grindelwald
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.57,1:03:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,格林德沃想让麻瓜和巫师开战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gellert Grindelwald wants a Muggle-wizard war,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.12,1:03:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,倘若真的如他所愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and if he gets his wish,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.62,1:03:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不仅会毁了麻瓜世界  还会毁了魔法世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he won't just destroy their world, he'll destroy ours as well.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.29,1:03:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,所以说  他不能获胜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is why he cannot win.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.79,1:04:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们让他成为候选人  让大家来投票\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let him stand as a candidate. Let the people vote.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.34,1:04:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,即便他落选了  那也是民众之愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When he loses, the people will have spoken.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.22,1:04:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,但是如果不给他们发声的权利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But deny them their voices,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.93,1:04:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,那么大街小巷将会血流成河\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and those streets will run with blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.83,1:04:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,忒修斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Theseus.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.17,1:04:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,忒修斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Theseus.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.47,1:06:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,拉莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lally,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.43,1:06:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那个发型奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the guy with the hair,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.94,1:06:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,坐伊迪丝旁边的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sitting next to Edith.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.44,1:06:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,像是会杀人的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He looks like he can kill somebody.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.94,1:06:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他长得很像我叔叔多米尼克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He also looks like my Uncle Dominic.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.15,1:06:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那你的叔叔多米尼克  是挪威魔法部的部长吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is your Uncle Dominic the Norwegian Minister of Magic?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.57,1:06:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.16,1:06:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜也不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.10,1:07:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,奎妮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Queenie.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.57,1:07:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Queenie.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.74,1:07:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,桑托斯夫人  很荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Madam Santos, a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.79,1:07:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你的支持者们真是热情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your supporters are in fine voice.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.92,1:07:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你的也是如此  格林德沃先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As are yours, Mr. Grindelwald.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.06,1:07:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是来救我的吗  - 是这么打算的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rescuing me, are you?  - That's the general idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.11,1:07:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,那想必\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I presume this,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.74,1:07:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你之所以用这个姿势走路一定是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whatever it is that you are doing,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.41,1:08:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 战略需要  - 没错  这是一种拟态仿生技巧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- is strategic.  - Yes, a technique called limbic mimicry.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.49,1:08:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,理论上说  可以缓解动物的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It discourages violent engagement,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.20,1:08:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,暴力倾向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}theoretically.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.25,1:08:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,其实  我以前只试用过一次而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've only actually ever attempted it once before.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.92,1:08:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,效果怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the results?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.04,1:08:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,还没有定论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inconclusive.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.67,1:08:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,因为那是在实验室里  严控条件下模拟的环境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Course that was a laboratory setting and the conditions were strictly controlled, and the...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.80,1:08:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,而且  目前的情况更加不稳定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the current conditions are more volatile,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.63,1:08:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,所以更难判断最终结果会是怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so making it less predictive of the ultimate outcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.60,1:08:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这次的最终结果应该是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ultimate outcome presumably...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.97,1:08:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.93,1:08:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,可以活着出去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}being our survival.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.03,1:09:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,干得好  走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.00,1:09:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 所以下面的计划是  - 你拿着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And the plan is?  - Hold this.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.97,1:09:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你那样做能有什么用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the bloody hell was that for?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.02,1:09:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna need some help.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.07,1:10:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.16,1:10:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,跟着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.25,1:10:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,跟上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.84,1:10:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你这样扭得不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not swiveling properly.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.26,1:10:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这么扭  扭起来  也要小心翼翼的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Swivel... Swivel, but delicately.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.22,1:10:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你扭得一模一样  纽特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm swiveling like you're swiveling, Newt.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.72,1:10:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我看着可差远了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.62,1:10:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,接着扭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Swivel.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.97,1:11:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,去找他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.68,1:11:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,奎妮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Queenie.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.27,1:11:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,跟他说没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell him it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.61,1:11:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,看得出来他失败了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can see he's failed.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.11,1:11:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,他还会有机会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll have another chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.41,1:11:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我最看重的是他的忠心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's his loyalty I most value.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.36,1:12:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,在这儿别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.34,1:12:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apologies.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.93,1:12:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.41,1:12:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,放过她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let her go.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.79,1:12:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.97,1:13:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,有刺客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Assassin!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.73,1:16:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,救命啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.89,1:17:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.73,1:17:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,纽特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Newt!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.53,1:17:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,速速飞来  抓住领带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Accio! Grab the tie.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.79,1:18:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那是个门钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was a Portkey.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.96,1:18:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.34,1:18:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,多亏你们两个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done, you two.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.03,1:19:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然你们两个都没问我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not that either of you asked,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.58,1:19:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我建议你们一定要把魔咒课学好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I would highly recommend learning Charms.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.91,1:19:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,拉莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lally.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.04,1:19:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你俩怎么才来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kept you two?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.16,1:19:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们遇到了一些麻烦  你们呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, we encountered some complications. You?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.79,1:19:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也遇到了一些麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We encountered some complications.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.96,1:19:21.67,Note,,0,0,0,,(预言家日报：凶残的麻瓜)
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.76,1:19:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,雅各布想刺杀格林德沃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob tried to murder Grindelwald?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.55,1:19:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这事说来话长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a long story.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.59,1:19:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是蛇木做的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it really snakewood?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.01,1:19:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那还有假  当然是蛇木\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, it's really snakewood.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.52,1:19:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,能不能…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.39,1:19:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,很危险的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.65,1:19:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,魔力太强了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's very powerful.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.31,1:19:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,很罕见  如果落到坏人手里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's rare. If it got in the wrong hands, you know,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.77,1:19:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,就不妙了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}mess you up.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.78,1:19:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那你是从哪儿得来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did you get it?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.40,1:19:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,圣诞节礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it for Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.28,1:19:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,雅各布  看看是谁来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob, look who I found.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.16,1:19:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,是我的巫师朋友们  纽特和忒修斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my wizard friends, Newt and Theseus.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.45,1:19:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就像这样  懂吗  这个才是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're like this, okay, and that's me right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.91,1:19:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我得走了  好了  你们玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta go. All right, have fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.96,1:19:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,别做不该做的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't do anything I wouldn't do.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.25,1:20:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这也太不可思议了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you believe this place?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.09,1:20:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这么多迷你的小女巫和小巫师满地跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They got pint-sized little witches and wizards running around here.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.88,1:20:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,可不是嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't say.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.84,1:20:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,那刺客就是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was the assassin.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.80,1:20:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,纽特和忒修斯都在霍格沃茨上过学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Newt and Theseus both went to Hogwarts.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.01,1:20:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这我知道  这儿的学生都很热情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I knew that. Well, they're being very nice to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.06,1:20:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这是那几个斯莱特林小男生给我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Slytherin boys over there, they gave me these.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.02,1:20:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,很好吃  有人要吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're delicious. Who wants one?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.10,1:20:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我本人向来都欣赏不来  蟑螂团子的味道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never cared for cockroach clusters much myself,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.27,1:20:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不过  蜂蜜公爵的应该是最好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}although Honeydukes are supposed to be the best.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.98,1:20:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不要吃那个了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't eat that.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.95,1:20:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,先走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Off you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.82,1:20:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,麦格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}McGonagall.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.53,1:20:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,阿不思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Albus.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.99,1:20:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了  你们都做得非常好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done. All of you, well done.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.87,1:20:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜大家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.79,1:20:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 恭喜我们  - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Congratulations?  - Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.50,1:20:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,希克斯教授成功阻止了一场暗杀行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Professor Hicks managed to foil an assassination.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.38,1:20:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,而你还活着  而且精神不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you are alive and you are well.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.13,1:20:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都没按计划走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fact that everything
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.84,1:20:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我们的计划就是不按计划走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}didn't go precisely to plan was precisely the plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.34,1:20:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,反视法的基本招式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Countersight 101.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.89,1:20:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,阿不思  恕我直言  这不是又回到原点了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Albus, forgive me, but aren't we back where we started?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.51,1:20:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,要我说  我们现在处境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, I would argue that things are...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.31,1:20:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,比开始还要差很多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a great deal worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.31,1:20:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你还没告诉他们吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You haven't told them, have you?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.40,1:21:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他们已经允许格林德沃参加竞选了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grindelwald's been allowed to stand in the election.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.28,1:21:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么  - 怎么会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What?  - But how?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.24,1:21:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,因为沃格尔选择了容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because Vogel chose easy
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.45,1:21:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,而非正义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}over right.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.52,1:21:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.85,1:21:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不丹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bhutan.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.27,1:21:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,答对了  赫奇帕奇加三分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Correct. Three points to Hufflepuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.90,1:21:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不丹王国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The kingdom of Bhutan
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.94,1:21:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,位于东喜马拉雅山脉的高处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sits high in the Eastern Himalayas.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.19,1:21:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,那是一个美得无与伦比的国度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a place of indescribable beauty.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.69,1:21:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们研习的一些很重要的魔法  都源自于那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some of our most important magic has its origins there.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.32,1:21:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,据说只要你用心聆听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say if you listen carefully enough,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.99,1:21:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,就能听到往昔的密语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the past whispers to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.58,1:21:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这里也是选举进行的会场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It also happens to be where the election will be held.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.25,1:22:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他赢不了的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He can't win, can he?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.63,1:22:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,就在几天前  他的身份还是一名逃犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only a few days ago he was a fugitive from justice.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.25,1:22:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,现在却摇身一变成了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now he is an official candidate
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.17,1:22:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,国际魔法联盟主席的候选人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the International Confederation of Wizards.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.43,1:22:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,危险的时代  偏爱危险的人才\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dangerous times favor dangerous men.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.47,1:22:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,顺便提一句\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the way,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.60,1:22:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们晚上去村子里和我弟弟吃饭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we'll be dining with my brother in the village.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.64,1:22:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这之前若还需要什么  找米勒娃就行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should you need anything before then, Minerva is here.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.94,1:22:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,邓布利多还有弟弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dumbledore has a brother?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.00,1:22:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我们到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.76,1:22:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 邦缇  你也在啊  - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bunty, you're here.  - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.47,1:22:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 它怎么样  - 一切都好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How is she?  - Oh, she's fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.68,1:22:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,阿尔菲又干什么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's Alfie done now?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.56,1:23:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你最近没有再去咬蒂莫西的屁股吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, you've not been biting. Timothy's bottom again, have you?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.90,1:23:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,布罗德克女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Broadacre,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.23,1:23:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我弟弟招待得应该还算周到吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I trust my brother has been a gracious host?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.82,1:23:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  特别热情周到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, ever so gracious.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.36,1:23:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴你这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm delighted to hear.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.74,1:23:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,对了  已经给诸位  在村子里安排好了住处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, so, rooms have been arranged for you in the village,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.41,1:23:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我弟弟阿不福思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Aberforth here
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.03,1:23:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,会给大家准备美味的晚餐  他自创的食谱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will prepare you a delicious dinner, his own recipe.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.75,1:23:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不够的话  这边还有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's more of that if you want it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.63,1:23:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.59,1:23:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.93,1:23:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不可思议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Astonishing.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.52,1:23:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,从没吃过看着这么恶心  却这么好吃的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never has something that looks so repellent tasted so delicious.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.52,1:23:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这个小家伙是谁  安静点儿好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is this little one? Do you mind?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.90,1:23:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,它是只麒麟  雅各布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's a Qilin, Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.78,1:23:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,十分罕见的物种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's incredibly rare.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.74,1:23:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,魔法世界最受喜爱的神奇动物之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of the most beloved creatures in the Wizarding World.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.36,1:23:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.24,1:23:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,因为它能看透你的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause she can see into your soul.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.62,1:24:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,开玩笑的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.37,1:24:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不  倘若你为人善良\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. So, if you are good
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.33,1:24:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,而且值得信赖  它能看到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and worthy, then she'll see that.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.46,1:24:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,与此同时  如果你残酷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if, on the other hand, you're cruel
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.59,1:24:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,而且虚伪狡诈  它也能看出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and deceitful, then she'll know that too.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.59,1:24:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.35,1:24:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,它是直接告诉你还是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does she just tell you that or...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.60,1:24:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,它不会用嘴说  它用鞠躬表达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not exactly tells. Well, she bows,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.10,1:24:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,它只会在真正内心纯良的人面前鞠躬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but only in the presence of someone truly pure of heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.23,1:24:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,当然  大多数人都达不到标准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, almost none of us are, of course,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.90,1:24:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,无论我们有多一心向善\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no matter how good of a person one tries to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.61,1:24:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,许多许多年以前  曾经有一段时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was actually a time, many, many years ago,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.70,1:24:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,是由麒麟为我们选领导者的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when the Qilin chose who'd lead us.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.74,1:24:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.63,1:24:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  好了好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. All right, already.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.59,1:24:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,来吃吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.38,1:24:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,真活泼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thriving.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.14,1:24:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 它是饿了  - 看看它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's just hungry.  - Look at him.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.34,1:25:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 它很喜欢你  雅各布  - 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She really likes you, Jacob.  - Oh, all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.10,1:25:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.44,1:25:08.12,Note,,0,0,0,,(我想回家)
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.15,1:25:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好  这就对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.19,1:25:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.03,1:25:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我会帮你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.37,1:25:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,他是你的儿子  阿不福思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's your son, Aberforth.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.21,1:25:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他需要你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He needs you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.76,1:25:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,纽特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Newt.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.65,1:25:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,进来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.61,1:25:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,阿不思  楼下的镜子上出现了一行字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Albus, the mirror downstairs, there's a message.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.45,1:26:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,把门关上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.25,1:26:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那是克雷登斯写的  纽特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's from Credence, Newt.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.17,1:26:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我弟弟爱上了一个姑娘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my brother fell in love as well,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.22,1:26:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,戈德里克山谷人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with a girl from the Hollow.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.60,1:26:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,她最终被驱逐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was sent away.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.97,1:26:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那时就有传言说她生了孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There were rumors about a child.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.35,1:26:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 克雷登斯…  - 他姓邓布利多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Credence...  - He's a Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.03,1:26:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,倘若我待他好一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I'd been a better friend...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.20,1:26:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,或者做一个更加称职的哥哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to Aberforth, if I'd been a better brother...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.91,1:26:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,他也许就会对我倾诉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he might have confided in me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.49,1:26:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,情况也许就会不同  而那个孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps things would have been different, and this boy...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.42,1:26:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,就可能留下来  成为我们的家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}could have been part of our lives, part of our family.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.97,1:27:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,克雷登斯没救了  我想你也知道这一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Credence can't be saved, I know you know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.55,1:27:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,但他或许还可以拯救我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he may yet be able to save us.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.44,1:27:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,凤凰灰烬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phoenix ash.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.73,1:27:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那只鸟在他身边  是因为他要死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bird comes to him because he's dying,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.40,1:27:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,纽特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Newt.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.20,1:27:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我了解这些迹象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know the signs.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.78,1:27:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,要知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.99,1:27:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我妹妹也是一个默然者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my sister was an Obscurial.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.16,1:27:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,和克雷登斯一样  她也没学会控制魔法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And like Credence, she never learned to express her magic.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.75,1:27:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,后来那股力量黑化并开始毒害她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over time it grew darker and began to poison her.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.05,1:27:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,最痛心的是我们都无法缓解她的痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Worst of all, none of us were capable of easing her pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.10,1:27:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,能告诉我  她是怎么…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you tell me how it is that...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.14,1:27:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,她是怎么离去的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or how it came to an end for her?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.27,1:27:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,盖勒特和我计划好了要一起离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gellert and I had made plans to go away together.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.32,1:28:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我弟弟他不同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My brother didn't approve.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.74,1:28:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,一天晚上  他来找我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One night, he confronted us.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.32,1:28:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我们大吵起来  互不相让\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Voices were raised, threats made.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.91,1:28:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,阿不福思愚蠢地拔出了他的魔杖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aberforth drew his wand, which was foolish.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.08,1:28:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,更加愚蠢的是  我也抽出了魔杖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I drew my wand, which was even more foolish.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.88,1:28:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,盖勒特大笑着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gellert just laughed.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.01,1:28:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人听到阿利安娜下了楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one heard Ariana coming down the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.81,1:28:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不确定是不是我的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't say for certain it was my...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.56,1:28:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,咒语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}spell.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.86,1:28:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,已经无所谓了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't really matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.73,1:28:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,她前一秒还在那儿  后一秒就不在了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One minute she was there, and the next she was gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.24,1:28:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉  阿不思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry, Albus.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.24,1:28:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,但从另一个角度来说  或许这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if it's of any comfort, perhaps
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.08,1:28:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,省去了她许多痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she was saved some pain...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.54,1:28:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,够了  不要让我失望  纽特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't. Don't disappoint me, Newt.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.71,1:29:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,尤其是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You of all people.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.67,1:29:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你的诚恳是一份礼赠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your honesty is a gift...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.22,1:29:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,即便有时它会让人痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}even if at times a painful one.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.73,1:29:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,楼下的朋友们一定很累了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our friends downstairs will be tired
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.14,1:29:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,都想早些休息  你也…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and wanting to go home. You should...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.02,1:29:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你也去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should go.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.45,1:29:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,阿不思  拉莉曾经说过一段话  她说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Albus, Lally said something earlier
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.79,1:29:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,大多数人最终都是不完美的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about most of us being ultimately imperfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.13,1:29:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,但即使我们犯了错  无论多大的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But even if we make mistakes, terrible things...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.67,1:29:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还是可以尝试纠正\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we can try to make things right.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.80,1:29:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这才是最重要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's what matters...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.89,1:29:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,尝试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}trying.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.41,1:30:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们支持你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.33,1:30:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.21,1:30:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,属于我们的时刻就快到了  兄弟姐妹们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our time is close, my brothers and sisters.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.88,1:30:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不必再躲躲藏藏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Days of hiding are over.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.39,1:30:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这世界  将听到我们的呼声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world will hear our voice.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.10,1:30:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,震耳欲聋的呼声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it will be deafening.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.81,1:30:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,格林德沃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grindelwald
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.82,1:30:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是为了背叛邓布利多而来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't come here to betray Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.83,1:30:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你心中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know in
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.49,1:30:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,流淌着纯正巫师血脉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your pure-blood heart,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.33,1:31:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你属于这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your place is here.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.42,1:31:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,信任我就等于信任你自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To believe in me is to believe in yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.60,1:31:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,证明你的忠心  卡玛先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prove your loyalty, Mr. Kama.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.50,1:31:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,快快复苏  速速愈合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Vulnera Sanentur.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.08,1:31:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,快快复苏  速速愈合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rennervate Vulnera Sanentur.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.26,1:31:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,快快复苏  速速愈合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rennervate Vulnera Sanentur.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.31,1:32:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,快快复苏  速速愈合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rennervate Vulnera Sanentur.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.82,1:32:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.61,1:32:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好了好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There, there.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.95,1:32:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,乖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.49,1:32:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,过来  看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come, look.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.75,1:32:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是我们的特别之处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is why we are special.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.88,1:32:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,有意隐藏魔力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To conceal our powers
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.30,1:32:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不仅仅是对我们自己身份的极大侮辱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is not merely an affront to ourselves...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.22,1:32:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,更是罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's sinful.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.28,1:32:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,还有另一只吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was there another?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.11,1:32:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,另一只\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.66,1:32:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,那天晚上还有没有另外一只麒麟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That night, was there another Qilin?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.37,1:33:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,应该没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think so...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.29,1:33:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你让我失望两次了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's twice you failed me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.13,1:33:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你不明白这对我是多大的威胁吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you not understand the danger you put me in?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.72,1:33:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一次机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One last chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.93,1:33:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understood?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.18,1:33:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,快去找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find it.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.15,1:34:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿  纽特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Newt.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.49,1:34:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.08,1:34:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这是有求必应屋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The room we require.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.50,1:34:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,邦缇之前发给你们的票  大家都带好了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I trust you all have the tickets that Bunty gave you?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.21,1:34:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,没有票的话是进不去选举会场的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll need them to gain access to the ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.46,1:34:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样  纽特  看出哪个是你的了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think, Newt? Can you tell which one is yours?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.68,1:34:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.43,1:34:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那就好  否则我该担心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. I'd be worried if you could.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.26,1:34:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 麒麟就在其中一个手提箱里吧  - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I assume the Qilin's in one of these cases.  - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.97,1:34:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是在哪个里呢  - 是啊  哪个呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, which one is it?  - Which one indeed.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.23,1:34:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,跟三卡蒙特游戏一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooh, it's like a three-card monte thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.56,1:34:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,就是猜东西的游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like a shell game thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.48,1:34:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,就是  骗人的把戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like a short con.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.61,1:34:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不重要  是麻瓜玩的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never mind, it's a Muggle thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.65,1:35:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,格林德沃一定会倾尽自己的全力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grindelwald will do anything within his powers
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.78,1:35:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,来抢我们手里这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to get his hands on
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.95,1:35:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,珍稀的小家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}our rare friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.62,1:35:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,因此  此行的重中之重是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Therefore, it's essential that we keep
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.95,1:35:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,让他派出来的所有人都猜不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whoever he dispatches on his behalf guessing,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.41,1:35:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好让麒麟安全地进入到选举会场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so the Qilin gets to the ceremony safely.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.79,1:35:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,如果下午茶时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If, by teatime,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.71,1:35:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,麒麟  更不用说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Qilin, not to mention
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.09,1:35:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们大家都还活着的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all of us, are still alive,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.88,1:35:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们的行动就算是成功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we should consider our efforts a success.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.59,1:35:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,顺便说一句  玩三卡蒙特就从来没死过人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the record, nobody ever died playing three-card monte.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.97,1:35:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这个区别很重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An important distinction.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.81,1:35:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  一人拿一个手提箱  我们上路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, everybody choose a case and we'll be on our way.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.61,1:35:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,科瓦尔斯基先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Kowalski,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.15,1:35:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们两个人一起先走一步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you and I will proceed together first.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.98,1:35:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.82,1:35:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.93,1:36:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我十分期待你给我仔细讲讲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm looking forward to you educating me a little further
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.19,1:36:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,三卡蒙特游戏具体是怎么个玩法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the finer points of three-card monte.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.53,1:36:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,乐意至极\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.07,1:36:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.95,1:36:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,祝大家都有好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.70,1:36:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,大家好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.04,1:36:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,也祝你好运  邦缇姑娘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you too, Bunty girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.50,1:36:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,回见  邦缇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you, Bunty.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.60,1:36:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们作为领导层并没有忘记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is not lost on those of us in leadership
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.94,1:37:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,眼下我们正处于一个四分五裂的世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that we are currently a world divided.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.94,1:37:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,每天都会有人谈起新的阴谋论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Each day brings talk of another conspiracy.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.78,1:37:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,每小时都会有负面的谣传\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Each hour another dark whisper.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.16,1:37:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,而近几天随着我们  第三位候选人的出现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These whispers have only increased in recent days,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.37,1:37:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这些谣传已然愈演愈烈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the addition of a third candidate.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.92,1:37:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,要消除这些疑虑  让结果服众\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is only one way to leave absolutely no doubt
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.00,1:37:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,唯一的方法就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that a worthy candidate exists
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.21,1:37:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,证明诸位眼前  这三个候选人中有真正的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}amongst the three you have
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.01,1:37:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,贤能之人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}been presented.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.80,1:37:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,难道他有麒麟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does he have kylin?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.74,1:37:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,就算学校里的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As every schoolboy
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.53,1:37:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,都十分清楚  麒麟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and girl knows, the Qilin
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.91,1:37:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,乃是这神奇的魔法世界中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is the purest of creatures
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.58,1:37:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,至纯至净的生物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in our wonderful magical world.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.16,1:37:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人可以骗过它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It cannot be deceived.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.54,1:38:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,让麒麟带我们团结一心吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let the Qilin unite us.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.84,1:38:04.30,Note,,0,0,0,,(隐形兽)
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.52,1:38:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,桑托斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Santos! Santos! Santos! Santos! Santos! Santos!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.61,1:38:29.61,Note,,0,0,0,,(投维辛西亚·桑托斯一票)
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.22,1:38:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.39,1:38:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来去哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where to, next?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.60,1:38:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们要在这里暂别了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, this is where I leave you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.81,1:39:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,等  等一下  你说什么  暂别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm... I'm sorry, you're what? Leaving me?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.77,1:39:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我得去见另一个人  科瓦尔斯基先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to meet someone else, Mr. Kowalski.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.99,1:39:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不用担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not to worry,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.20,1:39:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会有事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'll be perfectly safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.58,1:39:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,麒麟不在你这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have the Qilin.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.20,1:39:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦发现情况不妙  你可以扔了箱子就跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feel free to drop the case at the first hint of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.75,1:39:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,还有件事  说了你不要介意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One other thing, if you don't mind me saying.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.96,1:39:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不要再怀疑自己了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should stop doubting yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.63,1:39:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你拥有的东西很多人一生都不曾拥有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have something most men go their entire lives without.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.59,1:39:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,知道是什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know what that is?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.64,1:39:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,一颗充实的心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A heart that is full.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.72,1:39:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,只有真正勇敢的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only a truly brave man
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.47,1:39:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,才能诚挚而毫不设防地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}could open himself up so honestly
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.89,1:39:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,像你这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and completely,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.85,1:39:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,敞开心扉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.22,1:40:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,桑托斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Santos! Santos! Santos!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.09,1:40:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,桑托斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Santos! Santos! Santos!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.21,1:41:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,手提箱  交出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cases, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.10,1:41:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿  伙计们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.57,1:41:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他生气了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's angry.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.17,1:42:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,等等  先打开确认在不在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. Open them, make sure it's in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.38,1:42:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,蠢货\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Idiots.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.19,1:43:18.07,Note,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.33,1:43:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let go of me
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.13,1:43:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.64,1:43:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let go of me
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.87,1:44:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他还能撑多久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long does he have?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.53,1:44:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这里  你很危险  知道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here. Hey. Hi. You're in danger, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.33,1:44:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你得快走  - 那…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You need to leave.  - Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.92,1:44:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能  我不能走  懂吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't... I can't go, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.46,1:44:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't come home.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.67,1:45:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,对我来说太晚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too late for me, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.09,1:45:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我犯的一些错误  大得无法弥补\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some mistakes, they're just too big.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.22,1:45:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you listen to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.51,1:45:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,没时间了  有人跟踪我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no time. I was followed.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.80,1:45:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我甩掉了他们  但他们很快就会找到我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gave 'em the slip, but it won't be long before they find me.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.85,1:45:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们会发现的  - 我不在乎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They're gonna find us.  - I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.64,1:45:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I got is us.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.31,1:45:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,没有你我的人生毫无意义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I make no sense without us.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.73,1:45:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,雅各布  什么  拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob, what? Come on...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.77,1:45:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经不爱你了  你快走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't love you anymore. Just get outta here.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:21.86,1:45:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你最不会撒谎了  奎妮·戈德斯坦恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the worst liar in the world, Queenie Goldstein.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.86,1:45:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 听到了吗  - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You hear that? What?  - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.49,1:45:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那是个预兆  太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a sign. Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.49,1:45:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 拜托  - 来  过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, come on.  - Come here, come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.83,1:45:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,闭上眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.08,1:45:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托  闭上眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.59,1:45:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,知道邓布利多说什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what Dumbledore said to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.92,1:45:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.67,1:45:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他说我有一颗充实的心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said that I got a full heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.10,1:45:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,他错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.22,1:45:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我的心永远都会给你留出位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm always gonna have room in there for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.19,1:45:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是吗  - 是  你知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah?  - Yeah. You know it.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.81,1:46:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.19,1:46:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,奎妮·戈德斯坦恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Queenie Goldstein.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.80,1:46:30.30,Note,,0,0,0,,(投维辛西亚·桑托斯一票)
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.80,1:47:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,斯卡曼德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Scamander.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.55,1:47:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还没有正式打过照面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've never been properly introduced.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.56,1:47:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫亨丽埃塔·费歇尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Henrietta Fischer,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.23,1:47:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,沃格尔先生的随员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Herr Vogel's attache.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.73,1:47:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好的  你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, uh, hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.94,1:47:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以带你上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can take you up.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.94,1:47:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,高级委员会的成员有一个独立入口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a private entrance for members of the High Council.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.07,1:47:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你只需要跟我走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you just follow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.70,1:47:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思  你为什么这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, why would you do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.07,1:47:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,带我上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take me up?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.08,1:47:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,难道还不明显吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.58,1:47:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不  坦白说  不明显\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, frankly, it's, uh, not.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.67,1:47:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,邓布利多派我来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dumbledore sent me.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.67,1:47:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你手提箱里有什么  斯卡曼德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what you have in that case, Mr. Scamander.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.11,1:48:10.15,Note,,0,0,0,,(投维辛西亚·桑托斯一票)
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.03,1:48:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,他应该很快就到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He should be here any minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.60,1:49:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么才来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kept you?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.66,1:49:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢几位候选人的精彩讲话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thank the candidates for their words.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.41,1:49:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,每一位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Each
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.37,1:49:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,所发表的精彩演讲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}represents a distinct vision
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.54,1:49:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,都代表了自己对于  如何塑造我们的魔法世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of how we will not shape only our world,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:45.75,1:49:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,以及非魔法世界的看法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the non-magical world as well.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.54,1:49:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,而接下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which brings us
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.38,1:49:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,就是本次仪式中最重要的一个环节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the most important part of our ceremony,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.01,1:49:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,麒麟的选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the walk of the Qilin.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.56,1:51:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,麒麟作出了选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Qilin has seen.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.89,1:51:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,它看到了纯善和力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seen goodness, strength,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.81,1:51:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这都是指引我们前进的领导者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}qualities essential to lead
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.73,1:51:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,必不可缺的品质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and to guide us.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:40.70,1:51:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,诸位的选择呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who do you see?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:43.24,1:51:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,格林德沃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grindelwald
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.01,1:52:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,盖勒特·格林德沃  是我们魔法世界的新领袖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gellert Grindelwald is the new leader of the magical world
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.05,1:52:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,口头表决通过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by acclamation.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.18,1:52:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这个人曾经试图刺杀我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the man who tried to take my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.01,1:52:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This man,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:49.85,1:52:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他没有一点儿魔法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who has no magic,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.10,1:52:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,却想娶一个女巫  污染我们的血脉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who would marry a witch and pollute our blood,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.40,1:52:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这禁忌的结合只会令我们不堪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}create a forbidden union that would make us less,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.40,1:53:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们像他的同类般弱小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}make us weak, like his kind.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:04.40,1:53:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他可不是孤例  朋友们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not alone, my friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:07.99,1:53:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,想像他这样做的人成千上万\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are thousands who seek to do the same.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.41,1:53:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的寄生虫只配得到一种对待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There can only be one response to such vermin.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:25.47,1:53:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.39,1:53:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,钻心剜骨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crucio.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:31.72,1:53:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:35.39,1:53:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,快让他住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make him stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:37.23,1:53:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们与麻瓜的战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our war with the Muggles
Dialogue: 0,1:53:39.98,1:53:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,从今天打响\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}begins today.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.44,1:53:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,格林德沃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grindelwald
Dialogue: 0,1:54:00.75,1:54:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,雅各布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:42.17,1:54:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他骗了你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's lying to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:46.55,1:54:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那个东西已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That creature is dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:56.64,1:54:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下  等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not now. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.23,1:55:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他是为了骗你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He did it to trick you.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:04.73,1:55:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他杀了麒麟  然后给它施咒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He killed it and bewitched it
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.53,1:55:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好让大家觉得他有资格成为领袖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so that you might think him worthy to lead.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.74,1:55:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,可他并不想领导你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he doesn't want to lead you.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.37,1:55:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他只想你们服从\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He just wants you to follow.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:19.92,1:55:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,谎言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Words.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.75,1:55:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这是精心编造的谎言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Words designed to deceive.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:25.92,1:55:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,让各位怀疑亲眼所见的事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To make you doubt what you've seen with your own two eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:28.13,1:55:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那一夜有两只麒麟诞生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There were two Qilins born that night.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:29.76,1:55:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,双胞胎  我知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A twin. And I know that...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.97,1:55:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我知道  - 证据呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I know that...  - Because?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:40.14,1:55:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本就没有证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you have no proof.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.19,1:55:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,因为并没有第二只麒麟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because there was no second Qilin.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:46.65,1:55:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我说得对吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I not right?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:47.86,1:55:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,它的母亲被害  它…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Its mother had been killed, it...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:49.03,1:55:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那它在哪里  斯卡曼德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then where is it now, Mr. Scamander?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:17.76,1:56:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,没人可以知道一切  纽特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one can know everything, Newt.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.77,1:56:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,记得吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:38.83,1:56:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:51.47,1:56:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我不理解  真是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:05.15,1:57:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,它听不到的  小家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She can't hear you, little one.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:09.02,1:57:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,它不在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not here...
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.11,1:57:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,或许在别处听着你的呼唤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but perhaps somewhere she's listening.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:18.28,1:57:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这才是真正的麒麟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the true Qilin.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:21.75,1:57:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好好看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at it,
Dialogue: 0,1:57:23.62,1:57:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都可以亲眼看出来  这只才是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you can see it with your own eyes. This is the true...
Dialogue: 0,1:57:32.46,1:57:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才这个结果不能算数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This can't be allowed to stand.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:35.05,1:57:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,必须重新进行投票\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The vote must be taken again.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:37.59,1:57:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好了安东  履行职责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Anton. Do something.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:08.29,1:58:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:09.75,1:58:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不  别别别  拜托了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:37.36,1:58:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我很荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm honored.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:40.49,1:58:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但正如那天晚上你们两个一起出生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But just as two of you were born that night,
Dialogue: 0,1:58:43.70,1:58:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这里还有一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there's another here,
Dialogue: 0,1:58:45.45,1:58:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,同样值得认可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}equally worthy.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.50,1:58:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这一点我确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm certain of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:05.64,1:59:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:08.10,1:59:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's impossible
Dialogue: 0,2:01:59.77,2:02:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,还有谁会爱你  邓布利多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who will love you now, Dumbledore?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:04.65,2:02:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你孤身一人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're all alone.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:13.95,2:02:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,桑托斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Santos!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:56.87,2:02:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我从不是你们的敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was never your enemy.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:05.80,2:03:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,从前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then,
Dialogue: 0,2:03:07.47,2:03:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,或现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or now.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:49.68,2:03:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你有想念过我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you ever think of me?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:54.22,2:03:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,一直想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:02.77,2:04:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,回家吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come home.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:52.78,2:04:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,它来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here she is.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:56.16,2:04:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你太棒了  邦缇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done, Bunty.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:01.71,2:05:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧  小家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, little one.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:04.46,2:05:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起  我一定吓坏你了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. I must have given you an awful fright.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:06.88,2:05:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不  我觉得有时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I think, um,
Dialogue: 0,2:05:09.34,2:05:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,只有失去过才能更好地  体会到它的重要性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sometimes it takes losing something to realize quite how much it means.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:11.26,2:05:13.43,Note,,0,0,0,,(皇家辰星汽轮公司 纽约)
Dialogue: 0,2:05:15.68,2:05:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,可有时候你本来就…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And sometimes you just...
Dialogue: 0,2:05:20.77,2:05:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,有时候你本来就清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes you just know.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:34.45,2:05:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  进去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, in you pop.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:37.74,2:05:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,科瓦尔斯基先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Kowalski.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:41.29,2:05:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我欠你一个道歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I owe you an apology.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:43.33,2:05:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我让你承受钻心咒的痛苦折磨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It... It was never my intent
Dialogue: 0,2:05:46.08,2:05:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对不是我的本意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for you to suffer the Cruciatus curse.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:48.67,2:05:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,2:05:50.30,2:05:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不过奎妮回来了  就算扯平了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you know, we got Queenie back, so we're square.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:52.55,2:05:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我能问你个事吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, can I ask you a question?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:55.59,2:05:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这个我能留着吗  就算是留个纪念\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I keep this? For, like, old times' sake?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:01.43,2:06:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我想不到还能有谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't think
Dialogue: 0,2:06:03.56,2:06:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,比你更配拥有它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of anyone more deserving.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:07.35,2:06:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你  教授\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, Professor.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:29.71,2:06:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不可思议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remarkable.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:31.09,2:06:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我不懂  你们不是不能互相攻击吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But how? I thought you couldn't move against one another.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:33.17,2:06:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We didn't.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:35.38,2:06:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,他寻求杀戮  而我寻求护佑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He sought to kill, I sought to protect.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:38.34,2:06:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的魔咒遭遇了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our spells met.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:41.64,2:06:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,就当是天意吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's call it fate.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:44.85,2:06:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不然的话  怎么才能实现我们的命运呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After all, how else will we fulfill our destinies?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:49.98,2:06:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,阿不思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Albus.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:52.98,2:06:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,请答应我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Promise me.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:57.11,2:06:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,务必找到他  阻止他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll find him and you'll stop him.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:26.85,2:07:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,阿尔伯特  别忘了那些馅饼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Albert, don't forget the pierogis.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:29.90,2:07:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,是  科瓦先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Mr. K.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:31.31,2:07:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,阿尔伯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Albert.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:33.02,2:07:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,果酱饼干最多烤八分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more than eight minutes on the kolaczkis.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:35.73,2:07:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,是  科瓦先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Mr. K.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:37.32,2:07:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这孩子挺好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a sweet kid.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:38.45,2:07:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,就是分不清蘑菇肉卷和白菜肉卷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He doesn't know the difference between paszteciki and golabki.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:41.11,2:07:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 亲爱的  - 哇哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, sweetheart.  - What?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:42.24,2:07:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,纽特听不懂你说的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Newt doesn't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:43.87,2:07:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我也听不懂你说的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:45.08,2:07:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,而你今天不需要管工作  还记得吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you are not working today, remember?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:49.87,2:07:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧  亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, are you all right, honey?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:51.75,2:07:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,是在为了祝词的事紧张  别紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you're nervous about the speech. Don't be nervous.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:54.00,2:07:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉他  亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell him, honey.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:54.92,2:07:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 祝词的事不用紧张  - 我  我不紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't be nervous about the speech.  - I'm not nervous.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:56.84,2:07:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这什么味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is the smell?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:57.80,2:08:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么有一股糊味  阿尔伯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is there burning? Albert?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:03.47,2:08:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我看你是在为别的事紧张吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mm. Maybe we're nervous about something else, huh?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:06.68,2:08:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道你在说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't imagine what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:16.15,2:08:19.40,Note,,0,0,0,,(科瓦尔斯基烘焙坊  科瓦尔斯基品质烘焙)
Dialogue: 0,2:08:23.32,2:08:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,第一次见到雅各布那天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, the day that I first met Jacob...
Dialogue: 0,2:08:26.58,2:08:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,第一次见到雅各布那天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The day that I first met Jacob,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:27.70,2:08:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都坐在斯蒂恩国家银行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we were both sitting in the Steen National Bank.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:31.92,2:08:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我万万没…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never would I...
Dialogue: 0,2:08:47.89,2:08:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜你是伴娘吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The maid of honor, I presume?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:51.81,2:08:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜你是伴郎吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The best man, I gather?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:55.98,2:08:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你的发型不一样了  - 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You've done something to your hair.  - No.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:01.61,2:09:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,对  确实变了  就为…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Well, yes, actually, just...
Dialogue: 0,2:09:03.91,2:09:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就为今晚  - 很适合你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just for tonight.  - Well, it suits you.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:05.49,2:09:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你  纽特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Newt.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:12.46,2:09:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你们好  - 嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello.  - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:13.46,2:09:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,看这是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look who's...
Dialogue: 0,2:09:17.46,2:09:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,见到你太高兴了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:19.71,2:09:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗨  - 你还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi.  - How are you?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:20.92,2:09:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你这身真漂亮  拉莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look wonderful, Lally.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:22.13,2:09:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你  纽特  谢谢夸奖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, thank you, Newt. I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:24.26,2:09:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:25.55,2:09:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,蒂娜  来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tina, come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:26.68,2:09:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你跟我说说美国魔法部最近如何  - 里面见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You must tell me how MACUSA's been.  - See you inside.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:34.81,2:09:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我呢  我这身怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about me? How do I look?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:37.02,2:09:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧  - 你也挺好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You all right?  - You look fine.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:38.61,2:09:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 确定没事  - 我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You okay?  - Yeah, I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:40.65,2:09:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不紧张吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not nervous, are you?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:43.53,2:09:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,刚拯救了世界  演讲可不能怯场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't be nervous about a speech after saving the world.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:03.63,2:10:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,历史性的一天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a historic day.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:06.59,2:10:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,从今天开始往后的日子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where once was before,
Dialogue: 0,2:10:08.93,2:10:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,和以前完全不一样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there will now be after.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:13.89,2:10:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,有趣的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Funny
Dialogue: 0,2:10:14.81,2:10:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,身在其中的我们却感觉它如此平淡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how historic days seem so ordinary when you're living them.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:18.94,2:10:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,或许恢复正轨的世界本应如此吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, perhaps that's what happens when the world gets things right.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:21.61,2:10:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,偶尔平淡的日子真是让人高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mm, it's jolly nice to know it happens occasionally.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:28.57,2:10:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我之前不知道你会不会来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know if I'd see you here.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:31.54,2:10:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我自己都不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wasn't sure you would, either.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:33.16,2:10:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿  纽特  - 怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, Newt.  - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:35.29,2:10:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,雅各布说他好像把戒指弄丢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob seems to think he's lost the ring.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:37.75,2:10:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是在你那里吧  - 没丢  好着呢  在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Please tell me you've got it.  - No, it's all good. Yep.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:42.21,2:10:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,吓我一跳  哦  好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That scared me. Jacob!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:46.47,2:10:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,皮克真乖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good man, Pick.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:52.97,2:10:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我可能应该…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should probably, um...
Dialogue: 0,2:10:56.02,2:10:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你  纽特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Newt.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:59.02,2:11:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢什么  - 谢谢你的牺牲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What for?  - Pick your poison.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:04.07,2:11:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,没有你  我做不到这一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really couldn't have done it without you.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:13.62,2:11:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我随时愿意再次帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd do it again, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:17.58,2:11:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你开口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should you ask.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:34.26,2:11:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:51.03,2:11:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 邦缇  - 邦缇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bunty!  - Bunty!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:52.62,2:11:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你们好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you do.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:53.78,2:11:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,邦缇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bunty!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:15.64,2:12:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你太漂亮了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow, you're so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:25.02,2:12:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,真不敢相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:41.08,2:12:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,对  女朋友  你们真是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, girlfriends, you are...
Dialogue: 0,2:12:47.88,2:12:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这位是  这位是阿尔伯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is, um... This is Albert.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:49.92,2:12:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道你们打过招呼了没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if you've met Albert, yet?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:51.09,2:12:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我们打过招呼了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We said hello
Dialogue: 0,2:12:52.01,2:12:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 拉莉你认识了  - 你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Have you met Lally?  - Hello!
Dialogue: 0,2:22:22.98,2:22:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,《神奇动物3：邓布利多之谜》
